worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_claim_evidence.js"
  ceiling 228
  rationale "Issue #1175 R3 classes b, c and e (2026-10-08): the claim evidence the browser router reads for the dialogue follow-ups, the composers and the lookups, each kind bound to the reader the handler itself runs, plus the #1173 R3 answer-shape reading the concept reader uses. Twin of rust/src/capability_routing/claim_evidence.rs; it disappears with the JavaScript mirror when the Rust-to-WASM dispatcher replaces it. Ceiling moved to 225 for issue #1175 R3 (follow-up round, 2026-10-08): the readers of the follow-up round (payload, recall term, summary topic, document operand, stated claim, other subject, memory query statement and the rest) join the class evidence. Ceiling moved to 227 for the fact_lookup row: fact_subject reads the subject one of the fact arms resolves. Ceiling moved 227 to 228: verifiable_spec also admits on the pattern arm reading a run of atoms (issue #531, 2026-10-08), as names_verifiable_spec does natively."
